	<Notes/>
	<Bcc></Bcc>
	<Body>Good Day,&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Kindly be informed as follows:&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
We have received the payment towards the subject RFP of the amount&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;{item.Properties.TenderAmount}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
We have created a workspace for you to be able to upload your Technical and Commercial responses. Kindly note that access will be revoked to these workspaces after the Tender Closing date&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;{item.Properties.EndDate}.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Kindly ensure that you submit your response in a timely manner.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Kind Regards,</Body>
	<CC></CC>
